<!doctype html>
<html lang="es" data-lang="es" data-view="short">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Angie Uesseler Cala</title>
<meta name="description" content="Angie Uesseler Cala, M.A. Diseñadora industrial y de producto. Modelado 3D, visualización y prototipado.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Angie Uesseler Cala, M.A.">
<meta property="og:description" content="Diseñadora industrial y de producto · Modelado 3D, visualización y prototipado">
<meta property="og:image" content="img/angie.jpg">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#FDFCF8">
<link rel="icon" href="img/isotipo-a.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: tarjeta NFC de una columna. Vista corta por defecto; "Ver perfil completo" despliega el perfil. El retrato vive dentro de un arco. */
:root{
  --off:#FDFCF8; --ivory:#F3F0E9; --nude:#E3DBCC; --obs:#101010; --deep:#BFA98A;
  --bg:var(--off); --surface:var(--ivory); --line:#DCD3C2; --fg:var(--obs); --muted:#6B6458; --accent:#8C7A5B;
  --chip:var(--nude); --btn-bg:var(--obs); --btn-fg:var(--off);
  --display:"Instrument Serif","Times New Roman",Georgia,serif;
  --body:"Jost","Futura","Century Gothic",system-ui,sans-serif;
  color-scheme:light;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){
  --bg:#101010; --surface:#191816; --line:#2E2B26; --fg:#F3F0E9; --muted:#A79F90; --accent:#E3DBCC;
  --chip:#24221E; --btn-bg:#E3DBCC; --btn-fg:#101010; color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#101010; --surface:#191816; --line:#2E2B26; --fg:#F3F0E9; --muted:#A79F90; --accent:#E3DBCC;
  --chip:#24221E; --btn-bg:#E3DBCC; --btn-fg:#101010; color-scheme:dark}

*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:300 16px/1.6 var(--body);padding-inline:20px;padding-block:0 48px}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}
.wrap{max-width:560px;margin-inline:auto}
:root[data-lang="es"] [lang="en"], :root[data-lang="en"] [lang="es"]{display:none!important}
:root[data-view="short"] .full{display:none!important}
:root[data-view="full"] .only-short{display:none!important}

.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-block:18px}
.mark{width:26px;height:26px;color:var(--fg)}
.lang{display:flex;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:3px}
.lang button{font:500 11px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.12em;background:none;border:0;color:var(--muted);padding:7px 11px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
.lang button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}

.hero{display:grid;justify-items:center;text-align:center;gap:16px;padding-block:6px 24px}
.arch{width:min(62vw,230px);aspect-ratio:4/5;max-width:100%}
.arch img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:999px 999px 6px 6px;background:var(--nude)}
h1{font:400 clamp(2.5rem,11vw,3.4rem)/.95 var(--display);margin:6px 0 0;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-wrap:balance}
h1 em{font-style:italic}
.ma{font:italic 400 .5em var(--display);color:var(--muted)}
.role{margin:0;font-size:.98rem;letter-spacing:.02em}
.role small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:8px}
.lede{font-size:1rem;color:var(--fg);max-width:40ch;margin:4px auto 0;text-wrap:pretty}

.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;padding-block:4px 18px}
.btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:50px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--fg);text-decoration:none;font:400 .93rem var(--body);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .15s ease}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;flex:none}
.btn.primary{grid-column:1/-1;background:var(--btn-bg);color:var(--btn-fg);border-color:var(--btn-bg);font-weight:500}
.contact{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;gap:2px;text-align:center;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);padding-top:6px}
.contact span{user-select:all}

.toggle{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:52px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--fg);background:transparent;color:var(--fg);font:500 .8rem var(--body);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;margin-block:4px 8px}
.toggle svg{width:14px;height:14px}

section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:30px}
.eyebrow{font:500 .7rem/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
p{margin:0 0 12px;max-width:62ch}

.studio{background:var(--obs);color:#F3F0E9;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:24px 22px;display:grid;gap:10px}
.studio .eyebrow{color:#B9AF9C;margin:0}
.studio h3{font:italic 400 1.9rem/1 var(--display);margin:0}
.studio .when{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E3DBCC}
.studio p{color:#D9D2C4;margin:0}

.proj{display:grid;gap:26px}
.case{display:grid;grid-template-columns:38% 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start}
.case img{aspect-ratio:4/5;width:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface)}
.case h3{font:italic 400 1.55rem/1 var(--display);margin:0 0 4px}
.case .client{font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px}
.case .rolelbl{font:500 .68rem var(--body);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 4px}
.case p{font-size:.93rem;margin:0 0 8px}
.badge{display:inline-block;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.06em;background:var(--chip);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px;margin-top:2px}
@media (max-width:420px){.case{grid-template-columns:1fr}.case img{aspect-ratio:16/10}}

.tl{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tl li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:5.6rem 1fr;gap:14px;padding-block:13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.tl li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.tl time{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.4}
.tl strong{font-weight:500;display:block}
.tl em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent);font-size:.9rem;display:block}
.tl p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0}

.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:0 0 18px;padding:0;list-style:none}
.chips li{background:var(--chip);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 13px;font-size:.86rem}
.sub{font:500 .74rem var(--body);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:4px 0 10px}
.langs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.langs div{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;text-align:center}
.langs b{display:block;font:italic 400 1.5rem/1 var(--display)}
.langs span{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted)}

footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:26px;display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:10px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}
footer .mark{width:30px;height:30px}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
  .full{animation:fade .45s ease both}
  @keyframes fade{from{transform:translateY(6px)}to{transform:none}}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
    <symbol id="isotipo" viewBox="2 8 84 84"><path d="M13.227 75.555A40 40 0 0 1 62.800 14.693L62.800 38.574A22 22 0 1 0 26.623 63.493Z" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M15.369 77.933A40 40 0 0 0 66 83.407L66 90H84V10H66V50A22 22 0 0 1 28.765 65.871Z" fill="currentColor"/></symbol>
</svg>

<div class="wrap">
  <header class="top">
    <svg class="mark" role="img" aria-label="Isotipo de Angie Uesseler Cala"><use href="#isotipo"/></svg>
    <div class="lang" role="group" aria-label="Idioma / Language">
      <button type="button" id="b-es" data-set="es" aria-pressed="true">ES</button>
      <button type="button" id="b-en" data-set="en" aria-pressed="false">EN</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="arch"><img src="img/angie.jpg" alt="Retrato de Angie Uesseler Cala" width="600" height="600"></div>
    <h1>Angie <em>Uesseler</em> Cala <span class="ma">M.A.</span></h1>
    <p class="role">
      <span lang="es">Diseñadora Industrial y de Producto Senior</span><span lang="en">Senior Industrial &amp; Product Designer</span>
      <small><span lang="es">Modelado 3D · Visualización · Prototipado</span><span lang="en">3D modelling · Visualisation · Prototyping</span></small>
    </p>
    <p class="lede" lang="es">Diseño productos desde la primera idea hasta su fabricación, con el mismo rigor en la técnica que en la estética.</p>
    <p class="lede" lang="en">I design products from the first idea to manufacture, with equal rigour in technique and aesthetics.</p>
  </div>

  <nav class="actions" aria-label="Contacto">
    <a class="btn primary" href="contacto.vcf" download="Angie-Uesseler-Cala.vcf">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 20h14"/></svg>
      <span lang="es">Guardar contacto</span><span lang="en">Save contact</span>
    </a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/573208390714" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20l1.3-4A8 8 0 1 1 8 18.7z"/><path d="M9 9.5c.3 2 2.5 4.2 4.5 4.5l1-1.2 2 .8c-.2 1-1 1.6-2 1.6-3 0-6.2-3.2-6.2-6.2 0-1 .6-1.8 1.6-2l.8 2z"/></svg>
      WhatsApp CO
    </a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/393482640767" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20l1.3-4A8 8 0 1 1 8 18.7z"/><path d="M9 9.5c.3 2 2.5 4.2 4.5 4.5l1-1.2 2 .8c-.2 1-1 1.6-2 1.6-3 0-6.2-3.2-6.2-6.2 0-1 .6-1.8 1.6-2l.8 2z"/></svg>
      WhatsApp IT
    </a>
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:angie.uc.di@gmail.com">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/></svg>
      Email
    </a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/angie-uesseler-cala" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="3"/><path d="M8 10.5V16M8 7.8v.1M11.5 16v-5.5M11.5 13c0-1.6 1-2.6 2.3-2.6 1.4 0 2.2.9 2.2 2.6V16" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      LinkedIn
    </a>
    <a class="btn" style="grid-column:1/-1" href="https://www.instagram.com/angieuesseler.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r=".9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
      Instagram
    </a>
    <div class="contact"><span>+57 320 839 0714 · Bogotá</span><span>+39 348 264 0767 · Italia</span><span>angie.uc.di@gmail.com</span></div>
  </nav>

  <button class="toggle only-short" type="button" data-view="full">
    <span lang="es">Ver perfil completo</span><span lang="en">View full profile</span>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
  </button>

  <div class="full">
  <section aria-labelledby="h-perfil">
    <p class="eyebrow" id="h-perfil"><span lang="es">Perfil</span><span lang="en">Profile</span></p>
    <p lang="es">Diseñadora industrial y de producto con más de ocho años de trayectoria entre Colombia, Italia y clientes internacionales. Formada en la Scuola Politecnica di Design de Milán y en ESDesign Barcelona, trabajé como diseñadora senior en Studio Fuksas, en Roma, en proyectos de producto, mobiliario y arquitectura.</p>
    <p lang="es">Mi especialidad es el desarrollo 3D. Exploro con agilidad múltiples alternativas, perfecciono la propuesta definitiva y la acompaño hasta el render, los planos técnicos y el prototipo. Conozco de primera mano la cerámica, el yeso, la silicona, la resina, el concreto y la impresión 3D, y diseño cada pieza pensando desde el inicio en cómo se va a fabricar.</p>
    <p lang="en">Industrial and product designer with more than eight years of experience across Colombia, Italy and international clients. Trained at Scuola Politecnica di Design in Milan and ESDesign Barcelona, I worked as a senior designer at Studio Fuksas in Rome on product, furniture and architecture projects.</p>
    <p lang="en">My specialty is 3D development. I explore multiple directions quickly, refine the final proposal and carry it through to renders, technical drawings and prototype. With hands-on experience in ceramics, plaster, silicone, resin, concrete and 3D printing, I design every piece with its manufacture in mind from day one.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="h-proy">
    <p class="eyebrow" id="h-proy"><span lang="es">Proyectos seleccionados</span><span lang="en">Selected projects</span></p>
    <div class="proj">
      <article class="case">
        <img src="img/wave.jpg" alt="Lavabo Wave de antoniolupi" loading="lazy">
        <div>
          <h3>Wave</h3>
          <p class="client">antoniolupi · Studio Fuksas · 2022</p>
          <p class="rolelbl"><span lang="es">Mi rol</span><span lang="en">My role</span></p>
          <p lang="es">Lideré el desarrollo 3D del lavabo: exploré y depuré sus variaciones hasta definir la forma final, y elaboré los renders y los planos técnicos. La propuesta fue aprobada por el project manager y la dirección del estudio.</p>
          <p lang="en">I led the basin's 3D development, exploring and refining variations until the final form was defined, and produced the renders and technical drawings. The design was approved by the project manager and the studio's leadership.</p>
          <span class="badge">Milan Design Week 2022</span>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="case">
        <img src="img/trieste.jpg" alt="Estación del teleférico de Trieste" loading="lazy">
        <div>
          <h3><span lang="es">Teleférico de Trieste</span><span lang="en">Trieste Cable Car</span></h3>
          <p class="client">Studio Fuksas · <span lang="es">Provincia de Trieste</span><span lang="en">Province of Trieste</span></p>
          <p class="rolelbl"><span lang="es">Mi rol</span><span lang="en">My role</span></p>
          <p lang="es">Por encargo directo de la dirección del estudio, lideré el desarrollo digital de dos estaciones junto al project manager, en un proyecto concebido originalmente para el equipo de arquitectura. Modelado 3D, exploración de alternativas, renders, paisajismo, animaciones, video y postproducción.</p>
          <p lang="en">Entrusted directly by the studio's leadership, I led the digital development of two stations alongside the project manager, on a project originally scoped for the architecture team. 3D modelling, design exploration, renders, landscape, animations, video and post-production.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="case">
        <img src="img/otto.jpg" alt="Divisor Otto de Altreforme" loading="lazy">
        <div>
          <h3>Otto</h3>
          <p class="client">Altreforme · Studio Fuksas · 2022</p>
          <p class="rolelbl"><span lang="es">Mi rol</span><span lang="en">My role</span></p>
          <p lang="es">Diseño del divisor y de sus patrones de perforación, concebidos para láminas de aluminio recuperadas de la industria automotriz: una segunda vida para el material.</p>
          <p lang="en">Design of the divider and its perforation patterns, conceived for aluminium sheets recovered from the automotive industry: a second life for the material.</p>
          <span class="badge"><span lang="es">Archiproducts Design Awards 2022 · Sostenibilidad</span><span lang="en">Archiproducts Design Awards 2022 · Sustainability</span></span>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="case">
        <img src="img/diaframma.jpg" alt="Lámpara Diaframma 1.6" loading="lazy">
        <div>
          <h3>Diaframma Lamp 1.6</h3>
          <p class="client">Scuola Politecnica di Design · <span lang="es">Milán</span><span lang="en">Milan</span> · 2020</p>
          <p class="rolelbl"><span lang="es">Mi rol</span><span lang="en">My role</span></p>
          <p lang="es">El concepto nació en un equipo de tres. A partir de ahí asumí el desarrollo completo: modelo 3D, prototipo funcional, renders y presentación final.</p>
          <p lang="en">The concept was created by a team of three. From there I took on the full development: 3D model, working prototype, renders and final presentation.</p>
          <span class="badge"><span lang="es">Ganadora · Isola Design Awards 2021</span><span lang="en">Winner · Isola Design Awards 2021</span></span>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="case">
        <img src="img/skate.jpg" alt="Patín Inline Skate" loading="lazy">
        <div>
          <h3>Inline Skate</h3>
          <p class="client"><span lang="es">Proyecto de autor</span><span lang="en">Personal project</span></p>
          <p lang="es">Patín de velocidad con bota baja para ganar precisión y un chasis que absorbe la vibración. Concepto, modelado y visualización.</p>
          <p lang="en">A speed skate with a low-cut boot for precision and a chassis that absorbs vibration. Concept, modelling and visualisation.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="case">
        <img src="img/ctset.jpg" alt="Set de café y té CT-Set" loading="lazy">
        <div>
          <h3>CT-Set</h3>
          <p class="client"><span lang="es">Proyecto de autor · cerámica</span><span lang="en">Personal project · ceramics</span></p>
          <p lang="es">Set para café y té desarrollado de principio a fin: diseño, moldes de yeso y producción de las piezas en cerámica.</p>
          <p lang="en">A coffee and tea set developed end to end: design, plaster moulds and production of the ceramic pieces.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="h-studio">
    <div class="studio">
      <p class="eyebrow" id="h-studio"><span lang="es">Estudio propio</span><span lang="en">My studio</span></p>
      <h3>Zhezu Studio 3D</h3>
      <div class="when"><span lang="es">Fundadora · 2024 – hoy</span><span lang="en">Founder · 2024 – present</span></div>
      <p lang="es">Estudio de diseño y fabricación digital. Modelado 3D de precisión, repuestos a medida e impresión 3D bajo pedido en FDM y resina.</p>
      <p lang="en">A design and digital fabrication studio. Precision 3D modelling, custom replacement parts and on-demand 3D printing in FDM and resin.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="h-exp">
    <p class="eyebrow" id="h-exp"><span lang="es">Experiencia</span><span lang="en">Experience</span></p>
    <ol class="tl">
      <li><time>2024 – <span lang="es">hoy</span><span lang="en">now</span></time><div><strong>Zhezu Studio 3D</strong><em lang="es">Fundadora y directora de diseño · Bogotá</em><em lang="en">Founder &amp; Design Director · Bogotá</em><p lang="es">Dirección creativa y técnica del estudio: diseño de producto a medida, modelado 3D, prototipado e impresión 3D para toy art y mobiliario.</p><p lang="en">Creative and technical direction of the studio: bespoke product design, 3D modelling, prototyping and 3D printing for toy art and furniture.</p></div></li>
      <li><time>2023 – 2026</time><div><strong>NAHÜAL</strong><em lang="es">Cofundadora · Product &amp; Project Design Manager · Australia (remoto)</em><em lang="en">Co-founder · Product &amp; Project Design Manager · Australia (remote)</em><p lang="es">Dirección integral de proyectos de producto, mobiliario y cerámica, entre ellos el desarrollo para una marca australiana de bebidas en lata, con equipos en distintas zonas horarias.</p><p lang="en">End-to-end management of product, furniture and ceramics projects, including work for an Australian canned-beverage brand, with teams across several time zones.</p></div></li>
      <li><time>2021 – 2022</time><div><strong>Studio Fuksas</strong><em lang="es">Senior Industrial &amp; Product Designer · Roma</em><em lang="en">Senior Industrial &amp; Product Designer · Rome</em><p lang="es">En 2022, responsable del desarrollo digital del área de diseño: modelado 3D, visualización y planos para producto, mobiliario y arquitectura. Dos proyectos presentados en la Milan Design Week 2022, uno de ellos premiado, y participación en el concurso NEOM (Arabia Saudita).</p><p lang="en">In 2022, responsible for the design department's digital development: 3D modelling, visualisation and drawings for product, furniture and architecture. Two projects shown at Milan Design Week 2022, one of them awarded, and contribution to the NEOM competition (Saudi Arabia).</p></div></li>
      <li><time>2021</time><div><strong>Dowan Ceramics</strong><em lang="es">Global Designer Program · Estados Unidos</em><em lang="en">Global Designer Program · United States</em><p lang="es">Concepto para una línea de vajilla diseñada en torno a porciones equilibradas.</p><p lang="en">Concept for a tableware line designed around balanced portions.</p></div></li>
      <li><time>2020</time><div><strong>Studio Marco Merendi</strong><em lang="es">Diseñadora industrial · Milán</em><em lang="en">Industrial Designer · Milan</em><p lang="es">Mesas, accesorios y divisores en concreto para Gypsum y Colorskin, y participación en la cocina Libera para Elmar.</p><p lang="en">Concrete tables, accessories and dividers for Gypsum and Colorskin, and contribution to the Libera kitchen for Elmar.</p></div></li>
      <li><time>2019</time><div><strong>Naps Snacks · The Gummy Box</strong><em lang="es">Artista y modeladora 3D · Colombia</em><em lang="en">3D Artist &amp; Modeller · Colombia</em><p lang="es">Modelado 3D e impresión de moldes para termoformado en el lanzamiento de nuevas líneas de confitería.</p><p lang="en">3D modelling and printed moulds for thermoforming in the launch of new confectionery lines.</p></div></li>
      <li><time>2018 – 2024</time><div><strong>Freelance</strong><em lang="es">Diseño de producto, visualización y prototipado</em><em lang="en">Product design, visualisation and prototyping</em><p lang="es">Proyectos para clientes internacionales que dieron origen a Zhezu Studio 3D.</p><p lang="en">Projects for international clients that laid the foundation for Zhezu Studio 3D.</p></div></li>
